# Agent-Engine

Charter: `src/engine/AGENTS.md`. Spec: REQ-COL-LIGHT, REQ-MAPS, REQ-AI-PART (FX).

Allowed: `three`, `src/core/*`, `public/models`, `public/textures`.

Must implement: AmbientLight + tank SpotLight shadows; maps 1–3; Points particles; ShaderMaterial shields/ground; camera rigs; `.dispose()` on teardown.

```javascript
// ❌ INVALID
import { evaluateDamage } from '../logic/combat.js'
document.getElementById('ui-root').innerHTML = ''
fetch('/api/scores')

// ✅ VALID
import * as THREE from 'three'
import { EventBus } from '../core/EventBus.js'
```

No HP, win conditions, HTTP, WebSockets, or `#ui-root` writes.
